recommend keep-going -- three findings closed: the fleet-wide red is closed with the roster's own mechanism and proven on metal in this tree, run_verdict=ok skipped_capability=1; the document half of ASCII-first now has a meter over its whole subject with both rule rooms at zero and a sweep proven to have moved no prose. Two finds stay sized and unclaimed: the two-level fold rooms hold 890 more depth-lost links, and both comment ASCII meters swallow their own awk's complaint the way this one's first draft did.
